---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Press" description="Press kit for Tomebound Tactics: fact sheet, teaser video, and contact.">
  <span class="badge">In development</span>
  <h1>Press kit</h1>
  <p class="lede">Tomebound Tactics is a mobile PvP strategy game where elemental wizards battle on a hex board — and level up by studying real books.</p>

  <h2>Fact sheet</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr><th>Title</th><td>Tomebound Tactics</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Genre</th><td>Mobile PvP strategy</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Players</th><td>1 v 1, three wizards per side</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Board</th><td>Randomly generated, 61 hexes, 3 shrines</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Schools</th><td>Pyro, Frost, Storm, Verdant, Geo, Umbral</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Progression</th><td>Scan a book's ISBN; one study per wizard per day; rank from the book's original publication year</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Epochs</th><td>Eight-week seasons; launch epoch: Alchemist Reign</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Business model</th><td>Cosmetics and Featured Tome sponsorships only — never pay to win</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Status</th><td>In development; no launch date announced</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Teaser</h2>
  <video class="hero" src="/teaser.mp4" poster="/emblem.png" controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
    Your browser does not support the video tag. <a href="/teaser.mp4">Download the teaser</a>.
  </video>
  <p><a href="/teaser.mp4" download>Download the teaser video (MP4, 15 MB)</a></p>

  <h2>Key art</h2>
  <p>The game's emblem is an open spellbook with the six schools' runes above it. <a href="/emblem.png" download>Download the emblem (PNG)</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Press enquiries: <strong><a href="mailto:castspells@tomeboundtactics.com">castspells@tomeboundtactics.com</a></strong>. For sponsorships, see the <a href="/sponsors/">sponsors page</a>; for the library pilot, the <a href="/libraries/">libraries page</a>.</p>
</Base>
